    {
      "id": "VA0lQVAdlcJ7PlaRyrMxH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 456.7999572753906,
      "y": 190.40000915527344,
      "width": 917.6193237304688,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1860148718,
      "version": 705,
      "versionNonce": 1477989426,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782232014687,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Searching problem involved\n       - searching product, article, and search in logs\n\n\nQ: Build a search capability..\n      - search is a very context base thing... on the basis of what data type \nwe want to search our search strategy will change.\n      - for eg: if we want to search across numbers we can use binary search related algoritms\n      - Our agenda is to search across text (Strings)\n\n- We need to build a text related search\n                                      ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Searching problem involved\n       - searching product, article, and search in logs\n\n\nQ: Build a search capability..\n      - search is a very context base thing... on the basis of what data type \nwe want to search our search strategy will change.\n      - for eg: if we want to search across numbers we can use binary search related algoritms\n      - Our agenda is to search across text (Strings)\n\n- We need to build a text related search\n                                      ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
